-- Blue Note (bluenotebourbon.com, B.R. Distilling Co., Memphis) importer, applied 2026-10-12. Run order: duplicate merges, maker row, part1, inserts.
-- Merges first: the writer renames/updates the survivors, and the family/expression unique index would reject a rename onto a live twin.
select cellar.merge_product('7a44419d-b311-4541-b060-e2ebb93eaaac'::uuid, '17313800-d83f-455d-8c4c-ec8549452dac'::uuid, null);  -- Crossroads, Toasted French Oak -> Crossroads (the site's Toasted: 100 proof, toasted French oak staves)
